@authToken = paste-jwt-token-from-login-or-register-response-here

### Create a device owned by the logged-in cane user

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Cane Device",
  "guardianUserId": "c122ea2c-d86e-4c1a-b800-379e7b9cbe50"
}
